	"limits": [
		"Example source artifact is abbreviated; actual records must include every referenced artifact.",
		"All179 exact IDs and all21 partial qualification records are materialized from the explicit real register for each self-test case.",
		"Every self-test report has acceptanceGranted=false, even for structurally complete synthetic rows.",
		"Real proof projection is an explicit parent-reviewed input; this checker never guesses required native/platform proof from keywords.",
		"--fixture-register is forbidden outside --self-test and cannot be combined with --register; portable fixture mode checks only artificial mechanical scope.",
